@ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5048

### Default title order
GET {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/paintings?page=1&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json

###

### Price ascending
GET {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/paintings?page=1&pageSize=12&order=PriceAsc
Accept: application/json

###

### Register a test customer (first run: 200 OK, repeated run: 409 Conflict)
POST {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "auth-test@example.com",
  "password": "ExamplePass!1234",
  "fullName": "Auth Test User"
}

###

### Log in with the test customer
POST {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "auth-test@example.com",
  "password": "ExamplePass!1234"
}

###

### Login with an incorrect password (expected: 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "auth-test@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword!1234"
}

###

### Register with an invalid email (expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "ExamplePass!1234",
  "fullName": "Invalid Email User"
}

###


